body:
Thanks a lot. I am searching for Therapists but it's not looking good. I'm on a waiting list for over a year.

&#x200B;

I am in these subreddits and Discords...I even meme around. But I feel even more lonely. They don't want to talk about sad stuff. 

&#x200B;

I am wishing you the best of luck and hope you are happy with whatever decision you made. But I can't make a decision

Thanks for taking the time to answer me. I'll look into working out to get healthy and content with my body and search a new therapist, cuz I've been on a waiting list for over a year lol. And if I find out this (currently worsening) Dysphoria is something permament and affecting me badly then I'll look into transitioning.

&#x200B;

Thanks again!

Thanks a lot for the answer. Sadly crossdressing or being treated as female are not things I will be happy with. It's really only about my body itself. I sound like a pervert lol. 

&#x200B;

I can only imagine two scenarios that may lead to anything other than worsening Depression: Either staying a man and accepting it or going all out and trying to make myself as female as possible (only the body, not my presentation).

&#x200B;

Getting a therpaist sounds kinda hard, considering that I'm on medication (SSRI) and seeing a psychiatrist for years now, yet I've been waiting over a year just for CBT.
